
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Europe Love ❤️</title>

<style>
* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  color: #34212b;
  background: #fff7fa;
}
header {
  background: white;
  padding: 20px 6%;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
}
.logo {
  font-size: 23px;
  font-weight: bold;
  color: #c2185b;
}
nav a {
  margin-left: 14px;
  text-decoration: none;
  color: #553545;
}
.btn {
  display: inline-block;
  background: #c2185b;
  color: white;
  padding: 13px 22px;
  border-radius: 30px;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: bold;
}
.hero {
  padding: 65px 7%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 25px;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg,#fff0f5,#ffdce9);
}
.hero-content {
  max-width: 600px;
}
.hero h1 {
  font-size: clamp(38px,6vw,62px);
  line-height: 1.1;
  color: #a3154b;
}
.hero p {
  font-size: 18px;
  line-height: 1.7;
}
.heart {
  font-size: 120px;
  text-align: center;
}
section {
  padding: 45px 6%;
  text-align: center;
}
.cards {
  display: flex;
  gap: 20px;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.card {
  background: white;
  padding: 25px;
  border-radius: 18px;
  width: 230px;
  box-shadow: 0 5px 20px #ead6df;
}
.icon {
  font-size: 55px;
}
.card h3 {
  color: #a3154b;
}
.muted {
  color: #806b76;
  line-height: 1.6;
}
footer {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 25px;
  background: #402032;
  color: white;
}
@media(max-width:600px) {
  header {
    padding: 18px 5%;
  }
  nav a:not(.btn) {
    display: none;
  }
  .hero {
    padding: 40px 6%;
    flex-direction: column;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .heart {
    font-size: 90px;
  }
  .card {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 320px;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <div class="logo">❤️ Europe Love</div>
  <nav>
    <a href="#discover">Discover</a>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a class="btn" href="#join">Join us</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<div class="hero" id="join">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <p>❤️ LOVE KNOWS NO BORDERS</p>
    <h1>Find Your Love Across Europe</h1>
    <p>
      Meaningful connections start here.
      Meet new people, share your story,
      and discover the possibility of love.
    </p>
    <a class="btn" href="mailto:hello@europalove.com">
      Join Europe Love ❤️
    </a>
  </div>
  <div class="heart">💗🌍</div>
</div>

<section id="discover">
  <h2>Every Great Love Starts Somewhere</h2>
  <p class="muted">
    Discover new possibilities across Europe.
  </p>

  <div class="cards">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="icon">🌷</div>
      <h3>Meet Someone</h3>
      <p class="muted">
        Make a meaningful connection.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="icon">💌</div>
      <h3>Share Your Story</h3>
      <p class="muted">
        Show the world who you are.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="icon">🌍</div>
      <h3>Explore Europe</h3>
      <p class="muted">
        Love can begin anywhere.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="about">
  <h2>A Place for Real Connections</h2>
  <p class="muted">
    Be kind. Be yourself.
    Respect everyone's privacy.
  </p>
</section>

<footer>
  ❤️ Europe Love · Love, Respect & Connection
</footer>

</body>
</html>
